.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
# Terraform also writes timestamped backups, which `*.tfstate.backup` misses.
# A state file holds every secret in cleartext.
*.tfstate.*.backup
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
.terraform.lock.hcl
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
secrets/*

.mcp.json
